# Denunciation Effectivity Date

This scope computes the date on which a denunciation of the Agreement takes effect.

```catala
declaration scope DenunciationEffectivity:
  input notification_receipt_date content date
  output denunciation_effectivity_date content date
```

## Denunciation Effectivity

The denunciation takes effect six months after the date of receipt of the notification.

```catala
scope DenunciationEffectivity:
  date round down
  definition denunciation_effectivity_date equals notification_receipt_date + 6 month
```